    "text": "The relation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8484;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is:",
